---
import { groupFacts } from '../data/companies';
---

<section id="overview" class="overview-section" aria-labelledby="overview-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="overview-grid">
      <div class="overview-text reveal">
        <span class="label" data-i18n="ov.label">Group Overview</span>
        <h2 id="overview-heading" data-i18n="ov.title">
          A <strong>600-strong</strong> metallurgical organization.
        </h2>
        <p data-i18n="ov.p1">
          The Montanstahl Group currently has <strong>over 600 employees</strong>,
          with about 299 in Stabio (Canton of Ticino, Switzerland) and the remainder
          located across four production facilities in Schwerte (Germany), Talamona
          (Italy), Conroe (Texas, USA) and Tunica (Mississippi, USA) — as well as
          numerous commercial offices around the world.
        </p>
        <p data-i18n="ov.p2">
          The Group masters — often combining — <strong>six different production
          technologies</strong>: laser welding, hot rolling, hot extrusion, drawing,
          cold rolling and punching. This integrated capability allows us to meet
          every type of customer requirement with high-quality, economically
          advantageous solutions.
        </p>
        <p data-i18n="ov.p3">
          Thanks to their versatility and quality, Montanstahl profiles are used in
          <strong>construction, energy, oil &amp; gas, industrial plants, automotive,
          nuclear, defense, architecture</strong> and many more sectors.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="overview-side reveal" aria-label="Group capabilities">
        <div class="overview-card">
          <span class="card-eyebrow" data-i18n="ov.techLabel">Six production technologies</span>
          <ul class="tech-grid">
            <li data-i18n="tech.lw">Laser Welding</li>
            <li data-i18n="tech.he">Hot Extrusion</li>
            <li data-i18n="tech.hr">Hot Rolling</li>
            <li data-i18n="tech.dr">Drawing</li>
            <li data-i18n="tech.cr">Cold Rolling</li>
            <li data-i18n="tech.pn">Punching</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="overview-card">
          <span class="card-eyebrow" data-i18n="ov.indLabel">Industries served</span>
          <div class="ind-list">
            <span data-i18n="ind.con">Construction</span>
            <span data-i18n="ind.ene">Energy</span>
            <span data-i18n="ind.oil">Oil &amp; Gas</span>
            <span data-i18n="ind.ip">Industrial Plants</span>
            <span data-i18n="ind.aut">Automotive</span>
            <span data-i18n="ind.nuc">Nuclear</span>
            <span data-i18n="ind.def">Defense</span>
            <span data-i18n="ind.arc">Architecture</span>
            <span data-i18n="ind.more">… and more</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
